      "section": "Rarefaction curves",
      "order": 3,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "Diversity recomputed at a ladder of sequencing depths, several iterations per\ndepth, with the spread drawn as a confidence band. A curve that flattens means the\nsample was sequenced deeply enough for that index; one still climbing means\nrichness is bounded by depth. The index itself is a selector on the tile.\n",
